conky-spotify-nowplaying (1.2.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Resize the widget by dragging an edge or corner: the sides set its
    width, the top or bottom edge the height of the lyrics. Reset widget
    size in the top-bar menu puts it back.
  * Text scaling submenu in the top-bar menu sizes the text on its own.
  * Always on top toggle in the top-bar menu.
  * The widget starts at its saved position.
  * Lyrics show as many lines as fit and fade at the edges; instrumental
    lines show a musical note.
  * A placeholder cover while Spotify's DJ is talking.

 -- mfagerstrom <48690419+mfagerstrom@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 09:47:15 -0400

conky-spotify-nowplaying (1.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Minimize and close buttons next to the heart; the top-bar menu and
    opening the app again bring a minimized widget back (also: conky-
    spotify-nowplaying show|hide).
  * The heart is drawn like the new buttons and brightens on hover; it
    shows an outline, not grey, while the like state is unknown.
  * Background colour picks up a small accent colour on mostly grayscale
    covers instead of grey or black.
  * The app is listed once in the app grid (duplicate main category
    removed).

